---
// Why training a big model takes so long, as a receipt with the same paper look as NudgeReceipt. Each row
// puts this post's tiny model next to the biggest Llama 3.1 model. The dials line is the punch, with the
// real model's count written out in full in big type. Real-model figures come from Meta's "The Llama 3 Herd
// of Models" paper and the Llama 3.1 announcement: 405B parameters, 126 layers, a 128K-token vocabulary,
// about 15.6T pre-training tokens, batches of 4M growing to 16M tokens, and up to 16K chips. The paper gives
// no total elapsed time, so the time row says weeks to months. Llama is glossed as the family behind Meta
// AI (Meta's assistant in WhatsApp and Instagram), since readers know the app, not the model. No chip brand
// here; that belongs to part 5. Static HTML, no JavaScript.
---
<figure class="trc panel bleed">
  <div class="trc-receipt">
    <p class="trc-head">TRAINING RECEIPT</p>
    <p class="trc-cols"><span></span><b>tiny model</b><b>Llama 3.1</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>answers</span><b>3</b><b>about 128,000</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>layers</span><b>1</b><b>126</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>guesses per nudge</span><b>1</b><b>4 to 16 million</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>text read</span><b>3 sentences</b><b>over 15 trillion tokens</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>chips</span><b>yours</b><b>about 16,000</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>time</span><b>a blink</b><b>weeks to months</b></p>
    <p class="trc-sec">Dials</p>
    <p class="trc-row trc-n"><span>tiny model</span><b>9</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>Meta's biggest Llama 3.1</span></p>
    <p class="trc-note">Llama is the model family behind Meta AI, the assistant in WhatsApp and Instagram.</p>
    <p class="trc-big"><small>about</small> 405,000,000,000</p>
    <p class="trc-total"><span>Total</span>Every guess, should minus guessed. Every few million guesses, one nudge to every dial.</p>
    <svg class="trc-tear" viewBox="0 0 200 10" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0 L0 4 L10 10 L20 4 L30 10 L40 4 L50 10 L60 4 L70 10 L80 4 L90 10 L100 4 L110 10 L120 4 L130 10 L140 4 L150 10 L160 4 L170 10 L180 4 L190 10 L200 4 L200 0 Z" /></svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Real figures for the biggest Llama 3.1 model, from Meta's Llama 3 paper and its Llama 3.1 announcement. A token is a word piece, from part 1. The tiny model is part 1's, with its nine dials.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .trc p { margin: 0; }
  .trc-receipt { position: relative; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 10px; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; padding: 18px 16px 16px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .trc-head { font: 700 1.05rem/1.2 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; text-align: center; padding-bottom: 10px !important; margin-bottom: 6px !important; border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--line); }
  .trc-cols, .trc-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.8fr 1.25fr; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; }
  .trc-cols b { font: 700 0.72rem/1.3 Inter, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .trc-row { font: 600 0.95rem/1.35 Inter, sans-serif; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--line); }
  .trc-row b { font-weight: 700; }
  .trc-row span { color: var(--muted); }
  .trc-row b:last-child { color: var(--teal); }
  .trc-sec { font: 700 0.72rem/1.3 Inter, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin: 14px 0 2px !important; }
  .trc-n b { font: 700 1.4rem/1 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--text) !important; }
  .trc-row:has(> span:only-child) { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .trc-big { font: 700 clamp(1.7rem, 8vw, 3.4rem)/1.1 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; color: var(--teal); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin: 2px 0 4px !important; }
  .trc-big small { display: block; font: 600 0.85rem/1.3 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; color: var(--muted); }
  .trc-note { font: 500 0.85rem/1.3 Inter, sans-serif; color: var(--violet); margin-bottom: 2px !important; }
  .trc-total { margin-top: 12px !important; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 2px dashed var(--line); font: 700 1.15rem/1.35 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; display: grid; gap: 2px; }
  .trc-total span { font: 700 0.72rem/1.3 Inter, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .trc-tear { position: absolute; left: -1px; bottom: -10px; width: calc(100% + 2px); height: 10px; }
  .trc-tear path { fill: var(--bg-2); stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
</style>
